        "generator_prompt": "One isolated fictional game inventory painting for Project Heaven Cry RPG. A stylized, nonfunctional prop, shown in one single exterior perspective, no schematic or inset. Heavenprint hand-painted gouache, bold contour, visible angular brushwork, crisp focal edge, medium dark shadows, upper-left warm ivory highlights, wear kept within the object. First reference is brushwork only. Remaining refs are fictional RPG family icons; use their brushwork, palette and scale. Service Pistol repaint for the RPG. A compact plain block of matte charcoal sits above a moderately angled black grip and a squared thin guard outline. Level side profile pointing right. Clean flat top, short straight squared front, a small closed dark inset at its top edge, short rear scorelines, flush bottom and no external hammer. A single narrow desaturated blue-grey grip panel, lightly worn. One understated blocky exterior prop. On a true transparent 1024 square with clear margins, no stage or cast shadow. No print, letters, numbers, people, logos, insignia, flare, smoke, backdrop or colored frame. One clear silhouette readable at 32 px."
